{"id":"278b9d6853499788","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-transcendence.md","title":"Transcendence","display":"df-transcendence — Transcendence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-transcendence","aliases":["58-df-transcendence"],"display":"df-transcendence — Transcendence","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-transcendence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-transcendence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transcendence — Transcendence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md\">../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md\">../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,K,x\\in V\">\\(L,K,x\\in V\\)</span> (parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S\\)</span> (field-extension predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md\">../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K[t]\">\\(K[t]\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}\\)</span> (一元有限支撑多项式及系数支撑, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" href=\"?note=ab5e359a8ea0dcb4\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md\">../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (transcendence predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transcendence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S(x,L,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(L,K)\\land x\\in L\n\\land\\forall p\\in K[t]\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}(p)\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\sum_{i\\in\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}(p)}p(i)\\cdot_Lx^i\\ne0_L\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transcendence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S(x,L,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(L,K)\\land x\\in L\n\\land\\forall p\\in K[t]\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}(p)\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\sum_{i\\in\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}(p)}p(i)\\cdot_Lx^i\\ne0_L\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transcendence\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Transcendental}_{L/K}(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S(x,L,K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transcendence\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Transcendental}_{L/K}(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S(x,L,K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Transcendental elements satisfy no nonzero polynomial over the base field.</li>\n<li>多项式值按有限系数支撑显式求和；“非零”由支撑非空判定，避免使用未来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x)\">\\(p(x)\\)</span> 求值原语。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S$ (field-extension predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-field-extension.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md","status":"resolved","id":"ab5e359a8ea0dcb4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K[t]$ and $\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}$ (一元有限支撑多项式及系数支撑, see [[../batch19/58-df-polynomial.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,K,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"K[t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transcendence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S(x,L,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(L,K)\\land x\\in L\n\\land\\forall p\\in K[t]\\;\\left(\n\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}(p)\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\sum_{i\\in\\operatorname{supp}_{0_K}(p)}p(i)\\cdot_Lx^i\\ne0_L\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transcendence\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Transcendental}_{L/K}(x)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Transcendental}_S(x,L,K)","display":true},{"tex":"p(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1337,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-transcendence.md|58-df-transcendence]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["699918fd54cc2a8e","ab5e359a8ea0dcb4"]}